.SUBCKT BS170_ZX 3 4 5
*             D G S
M1 3 2 5 5 N3306M
RG 4 2 270
RL 3 5 1.2E8
C1 2 5 28E-12
C2 3 2 3E-12 
D1 5 3 N3306D
